A three-second bootstrap SVID can expire before Initialize finishes. Use
a one-minute lifetime while retaining mock-clock-driven rotation. Start
synchronizer test deadlines after expensive setup, and allow one minute
for their actual RPC work without changing retry or trust assertions.

